WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:59.145
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:59.415 --> 01:03.990
[Apocalypse Log 21]

3
01:09.125 --> 01:10.675
Come in.

4
01:22.916 --> 01:23.958
He Yao.

5
01:23.958 --> 01:25.758
Are you all right?

6
01:27.916 --> 01:30.800
It's all my fault. I didn't explain things clearly to Lie.

7
01:33.583 --> 01:35.716
It's fine. It's all in the past.

8
01:35.716 --> 01:37.599
Why are you here?

9
01:41.916 --> 01:43.716
I want to continue the experiment.

10
01:44.491 --> 01:46.583
This is your brother?

11
01:51.916 --> 01:53.208
Lin Zai.

12
01:53.208 --> 01:55.333
I've already told you about the risks involved.

13
01:55.333 --> 01:57.333
You almost couldn't handle it last time.

14
01:57.333 --> 01:58.833
Why don't we...

15
01:58.833 --> 02:00.609
Why don't we just stop?

16
02:01.416 --> 02:02.499
No.

17
02:02.499 --> 02:04.000
I can hold out.

18
02:04.000 --> 02:06.000
He Yao, you can't give up either.

19
02:06.000 --> 02:08.383
Don't you have someone you want to save too?

20
02:11.500 --> 02:13.883
You also have someone you want to save?

21
02:14.707 --> 02:16.000
He Yao has a younger brother.

22
02:16.000 --> 02:17.357
He was also bitten by a zombie.

23
02:17.357 --> 02:19.203
He's currently being held in Casia.

24
02:20.375 --> 02:22.009
What a coincidence.

25
02:23.458 --> 02:24.583
Lie.

26
02:24.583 --> 02:25.917
You don't have to doubt me.

27
02:25.917 --> 02:28.875
Lin Zai and I have the same goal.

28
02:28.875 --> 02:32.592
Perhaps... you wouldn't understand.

29
02:34.541 --> 02:36.583
It doesn't matter if I understand.

30
02:36.583 --> 02:39.791
But you'd better really be doing research.

31
02:39.791 --> 02:41.478
Tell me.

32
02:41.478 --> 02:43.062
What's your next step?

33
02:43.062 --> 02:45.446
Are you going to draw Lin Zai's blood again?

34
02:48.708 --> 02:49.921
Not for now.

35
02:49.921 --> 02:51.248
I have a new plan.

36
02:51.248 --> 02:52.637
But I need to prepare.

37
02:52.637 --> 02:55.770
I'll let you know once I'm sure the plan is feasible.

38
02:58.542 --> 02:59.748
What you need to do now...

39
02:59.748 --> 03:01.983
is to recuperate.

40
03:01.983 --> 03:04.450
Maybe we're getting closer

41
03:05.125 --> 03:07.150
to curing your brother.

42
03:07.150 --> 03:08.775
Really?

43
03:08.775 --> 03:10.275
That's great. Don't worry.

44
03:10.275 --> 03:12.325
I'll definitely be fine.

45
03:14.583 --> 03:16.133
Let's go.

46
06:24.775 --> 06:26.275
Where did you go?

47
06:26.275 --> 06:28.117
I just went out for a walk.

48
06:40.983 --> 06:42.533
What are you thinking about?

49
06:44.567 --> 06:46.150
He Yao's brother.

50
06:46.150 --> 06:47.742
What's his name?

51
06:48.400 --> 06:50.200
He Yao's brother?

52
06:51.025 --> 06:53.358
I can't remember.

53
06:53.358 --> 06:56.825
I think it was Chang... something.

54
06:57.483 --> 07:01.075
He Chang Huan?

55
07:02.150 --> 07:03.825
I don't think so.

56
07:49.083 --> 07:51.425
Why were you so distracted just now?

57
07:53.442 --> 07:54.950
It's nothing.

58
07:55.942 --> 07:58.325
You're in a good mood today.

59
07:59.983 --> 08:00.983
Yeah.

60
08:00.983 --> 08:02.817
My brother can finally be saved.

61
08:02.817 --> 08:05.367
He Yao said the experiment is promising.

62
08:15.108 --> 08:16.483
Don't worry.

63
08:16.483 --> 08:19.525
No matter what, I'll take care of myself.

64
08:19.525 --> 08:21.116
I promise.

65
09:31.375 --> 09:32.967
Brother.

66
09:33.900 --> 09:36.358
I feel so awful.

67
09:36.358 --> 09:38.025
What's wrong? Where does it hurt?

68
09:38.025 --> 09:39.825
Your head or your heart?

69
09:40.608 --> 09:42.608
It's just...

70
09:42.608 --> 09:44.741
I'm feel so stiff and uncomfortable.

71
09:49.025 --> 09:50.775
Let me go.

72
09:50.775 --> 09:52.908
Let me move around a bit.

73
09:56.042 --> 09:57.974
Just for a little while.

74
09:57.974 --> 09:59.576
I promise.

75
09:59.576 --> 10:02.001
I won't do anything stupid.

76
10:11.525 --> 10:13.025
Brother.

77
10:13.025 --> 10:14.775
I'm sorry.

78
10:14.775 --> 10:19.408
Last time, I was too harsh.

79
10:20.150 --> 10:21.733
I know.

80
10:21.733 --> 10:25.675
Everything you do is for my own good.

81
10:37.593 --> 10:39.185
Take it easy.

82
10:40.071 --> 10:41.662
Slowly.

83
10:43.292 --> 10:45.300
But sometimes...

84
10:46.167 --> 10:49.292
I feel like we've gone too far.

85
10:49.292 --> 10:54.010
So far that we can't find our way back.

86
11:01.750 --> 11:03.675
What are you doing, Chang Huan?

87
11:04.694 --> 11:06.410
Potassium cyanide.

88
11:07.167 --> 11:09.675
This is a deadly poison.

89
11:09.675 --> 11:11.725
Who are you planning to use it on?

90
11:21.816 --> 11:23.108
- You... - Let go!

91
11:23.108 --> 11:24.108
Give it to me!

92
11:24.108 --> 11:25.275
Give it to me!

93
11:25.275 --> 11:26.441
Let go of me!

94
11:26.441 --> 11:27.566
Let go!

95
11:27.566 --> 11:29.007
Give it to me!

96
11:30.775 --> 11:32.575
Give it to me!

97
11:47.292 --> 11:49.217
Why did you stop?

98
11:51.983 --> 11:54.775
Since you hate me so much,

99
11:54.775 --> 11:56.950
you might as well have bitten me.

100
12:00.316 --> 12:01.908
Sometimes...

101
12:03.042 --> 12:05.426
I've thought about ending it all, too.

102
12:27.608 --> 12:29.733
Chang Huan.

103
12:29.733 --> 12:32.025
Since you don't have the courage

104
12:32.025 --> 12:34.366
to turn me into one of you,

105
12:35.333 --> 12:37.883
then don't stop me

106
12:38.562 --> 12:41.237
from turning you back into one of us.

107
12:56.650 --> 12:58.233
Come on, Lie.

108
12:58.233 --> 13:00.316
Let's arm wrestle.

109
13:00.316 --> 13:02.366
Don't go easy on me.

110
13:11.775 --> 13:14.775
Hey, watch your hand.

111
13:14.775 --> 13:16.135
Right.

112
13:45.858 --> 13:48.108
You've been recovering well lately.

113
13:48.108 --> 13:50.691
Of course. I'll definitely beat you next time.

114
13:50.691 --> 13:52.441
In your dreams.

115
13:52.441 --> 13:54.033
Lin Zai.

116
13:56.400 --> 13:57.483
The new blood comparison

117
13:57.483 --> 13:59.191
and cell culture results are out.

118
13:59.191 --> 14:01.575
How is it? Any progress?

119
14:02.858 --> 14:06.275
Initially, your serum's effect on neutralizing the virus in vitro

120
14:06.275 --> 14:07.900
is better than just whole blood.

121
14:07.900 --> 14:11.525
However, to achieve a reversal and repair of the deep nervous system,

122
14:11.525 --> 14:13.733
we might need a component with higher activity

123
14:13.733 --> 14:16.108
and stronger regenerative capacity.

124
14:16.108 --> 14:19.491
For example, bone marrow stem cells.

125
14:21.941 --> 14:23.441
Extracting bone marrow?

126
14:23.441 --> 14:25.566
- Lin Zai's body has only just... - I understand your concern.

127
14:25.566 --> 14:28.108
But based on my recent observations and modeling,

128
14:28.108 --> 14:29.483
I've found that the zombie virus's

129
14:29.483 --> 14:31.108
erosion of the host's nervous system

130
14:31.108 --> 14:33.191
has an irreversible threshold.

131
14:33.191 --> 14:34.608
In your brother's case,

132
14:34.608 --> 14:37.833
regular serum transfusions are too slow.

133
14:37.833 --> 14:39.966
We might not be able to wait.

134
14:42.483 --> 14:44.941
Okay, I'll do it.

135
14:44.941 --> 14:46.566
As long as there's a glimmer of hope,

136
14:46.566 --> 14:48.491
I have to try.

137
14:49.400 --> 14:50.991
Lin Zai.

138
14:52.090 --> 14:53.123
Lie.

139
14:53.123 --> 14:54.625
I know the risks.

140
14:54.625 --> 14:57.042
But my brother can't wait.

141
14:57.042 --> 15:00.358
Besides, I'm feeling pretty good right now.

142
15:00.358 --> 15:01.950
Really.

143
15:15.566 --> 15:17.375
When do we start?

144
15:17.375 --> 15:20.674
If you're ready, we can start now.

145
15:24.108 --> 15:25.275
Okay.

146
15:25.275 --> 15:26.991
I'll go with you.

147
15:54.708 --> 15:56.383
Where's the anesthetic?

148
16:01.441 --> 16:03.041
I'm sorry.

149
16:03.041 --> 16:04.083
I couldn't find any.

150
16:04.083 --> 16:06.293
Are you kidding me?

151
16:06.293 --> 16:07.941
It's okay.

152
16:07.941 --> 16:09.616
I can take it.

153
16:15.208 --> 16:17.133
Bite on this.

154
16:30.775 --> 16:32.575
Don't move.

155
16:40.358 --> 16:41.359
Don't move.

156
16:41.359 --> 16:42.991
Try not to move.

157
17:05.775 --> 17:07.491
It's done.

158
17:32.775 --> 17:33.775
Lin Zai.

159
17:33.775 --> 17:34.900
Take a moment to recover.

160
17:34.900 --> 17:37.741
Once you've recovered, go back and rest.

161
17:39.483 --> 17:42.033
I want to see how my brother is doing.

162
17:54.042 --> 17:55.842
We'll wait here.

163
17:57.775 --> 17:58.983
It won't be that fast.

164
17:58.983 --> 18:00.025
I still have to perform

165
18:00.025 --> 18:02.441
- centrifugal separation and purification. - How long?

166
18:02.441 --> 18:04.408
At least 40 minutes.

167
18:07.319 --> 18:09.908
You do your work. I'll do my waiting.

168
18:37.542 --> 18:39.108
What now?

169
18:39.108 --> 18:43.021
For Lin Zai's health, I'll give him a nutrient shot.

170
18:54.849 --> 18:56.941
Roll up his sleeve.

171
19:01.816 --> 19:03.408
Hold it down.

172
19:38.566 --> 19:40.283
Take care of him.

173
20:49.441 --> 20:51.033
Where are you going?

174
20:56.192 --> 20:57.734
Is it ready?

175
20:57.734 --> 20:59.275
Quick. Hurry, He Yao.

176
20:59.275 --> 21:01.075
Save my brother.

177
21:02.025 --> 21:04.525
The sample needs at least another half-hour of observation

178
21:04.525 --> 21:06.316
to ensure the cell activity is stable.

179
21:06.316 --> 21:07.850
If we inject it now,

180
21:07.850 --> 21:09.250
the risks are uncontrollable.

181
21:09.250 --> 21:11.813
You said 40 minutes for processing.

182
21:11.813 --> 21:12.857
Now we have to wait again?

183
21:12.857 --> 21:14.494
Science requires precision.

184
21:14.494 --> 21:15.858
If the activity is insufficient,

185
21:15.858 --> 21:17.900
the injection might cause a rejection reaction,

186
21:17.900 --> 21:19.950
and all our efforts will be in vain.

187
21:22.400 --> 21:24.817
Either you inject it in front of me,

188
21:24.817 --> 21:27.627
or I'm leaving with Lin Zai and the sample.

189
21:27.627 --> 21:29.650
Your choice.

190
21:29.650 --> 21:31.358
You're in such a rush.

191
21:31.358 --> 21:34.000
If it fails, can you take responsibility for that?

192
21:34.000 --> 21:37.325
Inject it, or don't.

193
21:46.983 --> 21:48.886
Fine.

194
21:48.886 --> 21:50.811
I'll inject it now.

195
23:05.067 --> 23:06.067
Brother.

196
23:06.067 --> 23:07.617
Brother.

197
23:10.917 --> 23:13.317
Can you hear me?

198
23:13.317 --> 23:15.317
Big Brother!

199
23:15.317 --> 23:16.442
Can you hear me?

200
23:16.442 --> 23:17.650
It's me, Lin Zai.

201
23:17.650 --> 23:19.367
Big Brother.
